# Avacyn, Angel of Horror: "return that card ... at the beginning of the next end step" is about the card it was, and a
# card that has left the graveyard by then is a new object that the delayed ability does not find (CR 603.7c). Bot1's
# Damnation kills Avacyn and her dies ability resolves and sets up the return (Delayed.Count = 1); in Main2, with that
# delayed ability waiting, Bot2 sacrifices Soul-Guide Lantern to exile Bot1's graveyard, so at the end step nothing comes
# back and Avacyn stays in exile.

